## 🔗 Advanced Escrow Features (from Business Protocol)

### Multi-Condition Release Triggers
```
releaseConditions = {
  AND: [
    { type: "timeout", value: "7d" },
    { type: "oracle", source: "delivery_confirmed" }
  ],
  OR: [
    { type: "multisig", threshold: "2/3" },
    { type: "arbitration", verdict: "payee_wins" }
  ]
}
```

### Escrow States Extended
```
CREATED → FUNDED → STAKED → 
  ├─→ RELEASED (conditions met)
  ├─→ DISPUTED → REVIEWING → RESOLVED
  ├─→ CANCELLED (timeout/cancel)
  ├─→ PARTIAL_RELEASE (split)
  └─→ CLAIMED (claim link)
```

### Fees Structure
| Fee Type | Payeur | Description |
|----------|--------|-------------|
| `escrow_fee` | Payer ou Payee | Frais de mise en escrow (0.1-0.5%) |
| `dispute_fee` | Loser | Frais de revue humaine (r% du montant) |
| `platform_fee` | Split | Commission marketplace |
| `gas_fee` | Sponsor/Payer | Frais blockchain (via paymaster)

### B) Services Off-Chain

#### `Risk Engine`
- Scoring des transactions
- Thresholds et règles d'escalade
- Détection de patterns d'abus

#### `Human Review Service`
- File de jobs de revue
- Interface reviewers
- SLA de traitement
- Stockage des preuves (hash IPFS)
- Audit log immuable

#### `Keeper / Scheduler`
- Exécute releases automatiques après timeout
- Gère les unlocks de stakes
- Déclenche les timeouts

### C) Interfaces

#### Portail Payeur
- Ouvrir une dispute
- Upload de preuves
- Suivi du statut

#### Portail Payee
- Déposer son stake
- Répondre aux disputes
- Suivi des transactions

#### Portail Review
- Interface de verdict
- Motifs de décision
- Export audit

